		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "By skipping or partially prefetching dynamic routes, Next.js avoids unnecessary work on the server for routes the users may never visit. However, waiting for a server response before navigation can give the users the impression that the app is not responding."
