		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Streaming allows the server to send parts of a dynamic route to the client as soon as they're ready, rather than waiting for the entire route to be rendered. This means users see something sooner, even if parts of the page are still loading. See the "
